  "prefLabel": "Mec 705.01 Initial Certification Fee",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 705.01 Initial Certification Fee.\n\n(a) The fee for initial two-year certification as a heating equipment installer and heating service personal shall be $50.00; and\n\n(b) The fee for renewal of a two-year certification as a heating equipment installers and heating service personal shall be $50.00; and\n\n(c) All fees shall be non-refundable.\n\nSource. #13631, eff 7-9-23\n\nAPPENDIX",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec700.html"
